<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Le<sp/>workflow<sp/>CHNS–ALE<sp/>avant<sp/>le<sp/>nouvel<sp/>AMR<sp/>{#fez_pre_amr_workflow}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">&gt;<sp/>Référence<sp/>:<sp/>`cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784`,<sp/>fusion<sp/>du<sp/>16<sp/>septembre<sp/>2026.<sp/>Lecture<sp/>statique<sp/>du<sp/>code<sp/>;<sp/>aucun<sp/>build<sp/>ni<sp/>test<sp/>exécuté.<sp/>Le<sp/>nouvel<sp/>AMR<sp/>du<sp/>18<sp/>septembre<sp/>n&apos;est<sp/>pas<sp/>utilisé<sp/>pour<sp/>décrire<sp/>les<sp/>capacités<sp/>antérieures.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Le<sp/>socle<sp/>à<sp/>retenir</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>parcours<sp/>déjà<sp/>supporté<sp/>est<sp/>:<sp/>lire<sp/>un<sp/>cas<sp/>→<sp/>préparer<sp/>un<sp/>maillage<sp/>comprimé<sp/>par<sp/>élasticité,<sp/>éventuellement<sp/>depuis<sp/>son<sp/>cache<sp/>→<sp/>injecter<sp/>la<sp/>position<sp/>et,<sp/>en<sp/>enlarged,<sp/>`psi`<sp/>→<sp/>initialiser<sp/>les<sp/>champs<sp/>physiques<sp/>sur<sp/>cette<sp/>géométrie<sp/>→<sp/>résoudre<sp/>CHNS–ALE<sp/>dans<sp/>le<sp/>temps<sp/>→<sp/>mesurer<sp/>et<sp/>sauvegarder.<sp/>C&apos;est<sp/>une<sp/>reconstitution<sp/>du<sp/>workflow<sp/>permis<sp/>par<sp/>le<sp/>dépôt,<sp/>compatible<sp/>avec<sp/>un<sp/>usage<sp/>quotidien<sp/>sans<sp/>AMR<sp/>;<sp/>les<sp/>sources<sp/>ne<sp/>prouvent<sp/>ni<sp/>le<sp/>fichier<sp/>de<sp/>paramètres<sp/>personnel<sp/>de<sp/>l&apos;utilisateur<sp/>ni<sp/>ses<sp/>réglages<sp/>effectivement<sp/>utilisés.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/solvers/incompressible_chns_ale.cpp#L28-L67),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/presolver_tools.h#L15-L39),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L744-L843)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">**Pré-AMR<sp/>ne<sp/>signifie<sp/>pas<sp/>absence<sp/>de<sp/>toute<sp/>adaptation<sp/>dans<sp/>FEZ.**<sp/>Le<sp/>socle<sp/>contient<sp/>déjà<sp/>une<sp/>infrastructure<sp/>d&apos;adaptation<sp/>arborescente<sp/>et<sp/>métrique<sp/>dans<sp/>le<sp/>solveur<sp/>de<sp/>base<sp/>;<sp/>cette<sp/>fiche<sp/>isole<sp/>le<sp/>parcours<sp/>CHNS–ALE<sp/>presolver<sp/>à<sp/>topologie<sp/>inchangée.<sp/>Le<sp/>nouveau<sp/>travail<sp/>concerne<sp/>notamment<sp/>son<sp/>couplage<sp/>correct<sp/>à<sp/>l&apos;AMR,<sp/>sans<sp/>attribuer<sp/>rétroactivement<sp/>toutes<sp/>les<sp/>autres<sp/>fonctions<sp/>au<sp/>commit<sp/>AMR.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L302-L331),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L414-L439),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L1310-L1342)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>1.<sp/>Choisir<sp/>l&apos;exécutable<sp/>et<sp/>construire<sp/>les<sp/>objets</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`incompressible_chns_ale`<sp/>lit<sp/>la<sp/>dimension<sp/>et<sp/>le<sp/>nombre<sp/>de<sp/>conditions<sp/>de<sp/>bord,<sp/>déclare/lit<sp/>le<sp/>fichier<sp/>de<sp/>paramètres,<sp/>puis<sp/>construit<sp/>le<sp/>presolver<sp/>**avant**<sp/>le<sp/>solveur<sp/>CHNS.<sp/>Les<sp/>instanciations<sp/>sont<sp/>`CHNSSolver&lt;2,true&gt;`<sp/>et<sp/>`CHNSSolver&lt;3,true&gt;`.<sp/>Le<sp/>pointeur<sp/>est<sp/>attaché<sp/>si<sp/>le<sp/>presolver<sp/>existe<sp/>;<sp/>le<sp/>`unique_ptr`<sp/>conservé<sp/>dans<sp/>`main`<sp/>maintient<sp/>sa<sp/>durée<sp/>de<sp/>vie<sp/>pendant<sp/>`run()`.<sp/>La<sp/>branche<sp/>MMS<sp/>lance<sp/>la<sp/>boucle<sp/>de<sp/>convergence<sp/>au<sp/>lieu<sp/>du<sp/>calcul<sp/>ordinaire.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/solvers/incompressible_chns_ale.cpp#L28-L67)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">L&apos;exécutable<sp/>enlarged<sp/>suit<sp/>le<sp/>même<sp/>ordre,<sp/>demande<sp/>`create_elasticity_presolver(param,true)`<sp/>et<sp/>instancie<sp/>`CHNSSolver&lt;dim,true,true&gt;`.<sp/>Il<sp/>ajoute<sp/>une<sp/>inconnue<sp/>auxiliaire<sp/>`psi`<sp/>au<sp/>presolver<sp/>et<sp/>au<sp/>CHNS.<sp/>`phi`<sp/>demeure<sp/>le<sp/>traceur<sp/>physique<sp/>;<sp/>la<sp/>reconstruction<sp/>de<sp/>`psi`<sp/>et<sp/>les<sp/>variantes<sp/>de<sp/>modèle<sp/>sont<sp/>détaillées<sp/>dans<sp/>[les<sp/>modèles<sp/>CHNS<sp/>pré-AMR](chns-models-pre-amr.md).<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/solvers/incompressible_chns_ale_enlarged.cpp#L32-L69),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L120-L155)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>2.<sp/>Préparer<sp/>une<sp/>géométrie<sp/>comprimée</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`Cahn<sp/>Hilliard/use<sp/>presolver=false`<sp/>fait<sp/>retourner<sp/>un<sp/>pointeur<sp/>nul.<sp/>Sinon<sp/>la<sp/>fabrique<sp/>construit<sp/>un<sp/>`ElasticitySolver`<sp/>possédant<sp/>sa<sp/>propre<sp/>triangulation.<sp/>`reuse`<sp/>essaie<sp/>un<sp/>cache<sp/>valide<sp/>;<sp/>en<sp/>cas<sp/>d&apos;échec<sp/>elle<sp/>résout.<sp/>`off`<sp/>et<sp/>`force_recompute`<sp/>résolvent<sp/>directement,<sp/>mais<sp/>seul<sp/>le<sp/>second<sp/>conserve<sp/>le<sp/>résultat<sp/>sur<sp/>disque.<sp/>Les<sp/>valeurs<sp/>déclarées<sp/>par<sp/>défaut<sp/>sont<sp/>presolver<sp/>désactivé,<sp/>cache<sp/>`off`,<sp/>multiplicateur<sp/>de<sp/>compression<sp/>initial<sp/>1<sp/>et<sp/>une<sp/>étape<sp/>de<sp/>continuation<sp/>:<sp/>elles<sp/>ne<sp/>révèlent<sp/>pas<sp/>les<sp/>paramètres<sp/>d&apos;un<sp/>calcul<sp/>réel.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/presolver_tools.h#L15-L39),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L96-L112),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/parameters.cpp#L1801-L1807),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/parameters.cpp#L1976-L2006)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`ElasticitySolver::run()`<sp/>remet<sp/>son<sp/>état<sp/>à<sp/>zéro,<sp/>choisit<sp/>les<sp/>assembleurs,<sp/>lit<sp/>le<sp/>maillage,<sp/>crée<sp/>DoFs,<sp/>contraintes<sp/>et<sp/>parcimonie,<sp/>initialise<sp/>`x`,<sp/>puis<sp/>résout.<sp/>En<sp/>mode<sp/>`chns<sp/>form`,<sp/>il<sp/>coupe<sp/>les<sp/>multiplicateurs<sp/>des<sp/>sources<sp/>utilisateur<sp/>et<sp/>multiplie<sp/>progressivement<sp/>la<sp/>compression<sp/>par<sp/>une<sp/>progression<sp/>géométrique.<sp/>Les<sp/>deux<sp/>autres<sp/>chemins<sp/>concernent<sp/>une<sp/>source<sp/>utilisateur<sp/>évaluée<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>actuelle<sp/>avec<sp/>continuation,<sp/>ou<sp/>une<sp/>source<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>référence.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L224-L327)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>**mode<sp/>fonction**<sp/>du<sp/>presolver<sp/>évalue<sp/>`phi(x)`,<sp/>son<sp/>gradient<sp/>et<sp/>sa<sp/>Hessienne<sp/>depuis<sp/>la<sp/>fonction<sp/>initiale<sp/>analytique<sp/>aux<sp/>points<sp/>de<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>déformée.<sp/>Il<sp/>ne<sp/>résout<sp/>pas<sp/>l&apos;évolution<sp/>CHNS.<sp/>En<sp/>enlarged,<sp/>seul<sp/>`psi`<sp/>devient<sp/>aussi<sp/>un<sp/>champ<sp/>éléments<sp/>finis<sp/>reconstruit<sp/>sur<sp/>le<sp/>maillage<sp/>courant.<sp/>Son<sp/>forçage<sp/>comprend<sp/>la<sp/>compression<sp/>issue<sp/>du<sp/>traceur<sp/>et<sp/>la<sp/>compression<sp/>enlarged<sp/>;<sp/>le<sp/>transport<sp/>est<sp/>explicitement<sp/>absent<sp/>à<sp/>ce<sp/>stade.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/scratch_data_elasticity.h#L169-L214),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/assembly/elasticity_assemblers.cpp#L326-L368)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>**mode<sp/>champ**<sp/>est<sp/>utilisé<sp/>ensuite<sp/>par<sp/>le<sp/>solveur<sp/>CHNS–ALE<sp/>complet<sp/>:<sp/>le<sp/>même<sp/>assembleur<sp/>lit<sp/>les<sp/>champs<sp/>FE<sp/>`phi`,<sp/>éventuellement<sp/>`psi`,<sp/>et<sp/>la<sp/>vitesse<sp/>relative<sp/>`u-w`.<sp/>La<sp/>compression<sp/>physique<sp/>utilise<sp/>toujours<sp/>`phi`<sp/>;<sp/>en<sp/>enlarged,<sp/>la<sp/>compression<sp/>supplémentaire<sp/>et<sp/>le<sp/>terme<sp/>de<sp/>transport<sp/>utilisent<sp/>`psi`,<sp/>avec<sp/>sa<sp/>largeur<sp/>propre.<sp/>L&apos;option<sp/>`mff<sp/>source<sp/>term=custom`<sp/>est<sp/>parsée<sp/>mais<sp/>le<sp/>commentaire<sp/>de<sp/>la<sp/>fabrique<sp/>précise<sp/>que<sp/>ce<sp/>chemin<sp/>de<sp/>forçage<sp/>n&apos;est<sp/>pas<sp/>raccordé<sp/>;<sp/>`off`<sp/>et<sp/>`chns<sp/>form`<sp/>sont<sp/>les<sp/>chemins<sp/>fonctionnels<sp/>de<sp/>cette<sp/>option.<sp/>Cela<sp/>ne<sp/>nie<sp/>pas<sp/>l&apos;existence<sp/>du<sp/>mécanisme<sp/>séparé<sp/>de<sp/>source<sp/>d&apos;élasticité<sp/>utilisateur.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/assembly/elasticity_assemblers.cpp#L373-L433),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/assembly/elasticity_assemblers.h#L460-L490)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>3.<sp/>Passer<sp/>du<sp/>presolver<sp/>à<sp/>CHNS</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>solveur<sp/>CHNS<sp/>crée<sp/>DoFs<sp/>et<sp/>mappings,<sp/>puis<sp/>contraintes<sp/>et<sp/>structures<sp/>algébriques.<sp/>En<sp/>ALE,<sp/>`MappingFEField`<sp/>est<sp/>lié<sp/>à<sp/>`evaluation_point`<sp/>avec<sp/>le<sp/>masque<sp/>position<sp/>:<sp/>modifier<sp/>un<sp/>autre<sp/>vecteur<sp/>ne<sp/>suffit<sp/>pas<sp/>à<sp/>modifier<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>réellement<sp/>utilisée.<sp/>Hors<sp/>restart,<sp/>le<sp/>mapping<sp/>commence<sp/>par<sp/>la<sp/>position<sp/>de<sp/>référence.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L265-L299),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L484-L524)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`set_initial_conditions()`<sp/>impose<sp/>d&apos;abord<sp/>la<sp/>position,<sp/>remplit<sp/>`evaluation_point`,<sp/>puis<sp/>injecte<sp/>le<sp/>presolver<sp/>avant<sp/>toute<sp/>interpolation<sp/>de<sp/>vitesse.<sp/>`overwrite_position_from_presolver()`<sp/>copie<sp/>les<sp/>composantes<sp/>`0…dim-1`<sp/>vers<sp/>les<sp/>composantes<sp/>`x`<sp/>de<sp/>CHNS<sp/>;<sp/>si<sp/>les<sp/>deux<sp/>solveurs<sp/>portent<sp/>`psi`,<sp/>il<sp/>copie<sp/>aussi<sp/>la<sp/>composante<sp/>`dim`<sp/>vers<sp/>`psi_lower`.<sp/>Après<sp/>compression<sp/>des<sp/>insertions,<sp/>il<sp/>met<sp/>à<sp/>jour<sp/>`present_solution`<sp/>et<sp/>`evaluation_point`.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L758-L787),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L809-L843)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Cette<sp/>copie<sp/>**ne<sp/>résout<sp/>pas<sp/>un<sp/>problème<sp/>de<sp/>projection<sp/>entre<sp/>maillages<sp/>arbitraires**.<sp/>`extract_subsolution`<sp/>associe<sp/>composantes<sp/>et<sp/>points<sp/>de<sp/>support<sp/>dans<sp/>la<sp/>cellule<sp/>de<sp/>référence,<sp/>parcourt<sp/>les<sp/>cellules<sp/>actives<sp/>source/destination<sp/>en<sp/>parallèle<sp/>et<sp/>exige<sp/>la<sp/>correspondance<sp/>des<sp/>layouts.<sp/>Dans<sp/>l&apos;ancien<sp/>parcours,<sp/>les<sp/>deux<sp/>solveurs<sp/>construisent<sp/>leurs<sp/>propres<sp/>triangulations<sp/>depuis<sp/>les<sp/>mêmes<sp/>paramètres<sp/>;<sp/>le<sp/>commentaire<sp/>générique<sp/>évoquant<sp/>une<sp/>triangulation<sp/>partagée<sp/>est<sp/>plus<sp/>fort<sp/>que<sp/>ce<sp/>que<sp/>réalise<sp/>`main`.<sp/>L&apos;invariant<sp/>opérationnel<sp/>observé<sp/>est<sp/>une<sp/>disposition<sp/>et<sp/>une<sp/>partition<sp/>compatibles,<sp/>sans<sp/>changement<sp/>topologique<sp/>intermédiaire.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/mesh_and_dof_tools.h#L38-L122),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L224-L233),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L265-L279)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">La<sp/>vitesse<sp/>et<sp/>le<sp/>traceur<sp/>sont<sp/>ensuite<sp/>interpolés<sp/>sur<sp/>`moving_mapping`.<sp/>Le<sp/>hook<sp/>CHNS<sp/>initialise<sp/>seulement<sp/>`phi`<sp/>:<sp/>il<sp/>ne<sp/>remet<sp/>pas<sp/>à<sp/>zéro<sp/>le<sp/>`psi`<sp/>venant<sp/>du<sp/>presolver.<sp/>Les<sp/>contraintes<sp/>non<sp/>homogènes<sp/>sont<sp/>recalculées<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>initialisée,<sp/>distribuées,<sp/>puis<sp/>l&apos;état<sp/>est<sp/>envoyé<sp/>à<sp/>la<sp/>rotation<sp/>temporelle<sp/>lorsque<sp/>demandé.<sp/>Ne<sp/>pas<sp/>confondre<sp/>cette<sp/>séquence<sp/>avec<sp/>le<sp/>nouveau<sp/>remplissage<sp/>explicite<sp/>de<sp/>**tous**<sp/>les<sp/>historiques<sp/>dans<sp/>le<sp/>chemin<sp/>AMR.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L785-L805),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L696-L709)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Un<sp/>commentaire<sp/>de<sp/>visualisation<sp/>pré-AMR<sp/>affirme<sp/>encore<sp/>que<sp/>`psi`<sp/>n&apos;est<sp/>«<sp/>jamais<sp/>injecté<sp/>».<sp/>C&apos;est<sp/>un<sp/>commentaire<sp/>périmé<sp/>:<sp/>le<sp/>code<sp/>de<sp/>copie<sp/>ci-dessus<sp/>et<sp/>le<sp/>[patch<sp/>d&apos;injection<sp/>de<sp/>psi<sp/>du<sp/>2<sp/>juillet](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/commit/7ae5094cf2a23005f89af4788bdf4d330ddeeab9)<sp/>montrent<sp/>le<sp/>contraire.<sp/>Ce<sp/>constat<sp/>porte<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>documentation<sp/>interne,<sp/>pas<sp/>sur<sp/>un<sp/>défaut<sp/>numérique<sp/>nouvellement<sp/>diagnostiqué.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L656-L662),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L820-L842)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>4.<sp/>Imposer<sp/>les<sp/>bords<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>bonne<sp/>géométrie</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Les<sp/>BC<sp/>de<sp/>position<sp/>utilisent<sp/>`fixed_mapping`<sp/>;<sp/>les<sp/>BC<sp/>de<sp/>vitesse,<sp/>pression<sp/>et<sp/>traceur<sp/>utilisent<sp/>`moving_mapping`.<sp/>`update_boundary_conditions()`<sp/>passe<sp/>deux<sp/>fois<sp/>:<sp/>appliquer<sp/>les<sp/>positions,<sp/>mettre<sp/>à<sp/>jour<sp/>`evaluation_point`,<sp/>puis<sp/>réévaluer<sp/>les<sp/>autres<sp/>champs<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>nouvelle<sp/>géométrie.<sp/>Le<sp/>même<sp/>ordre<sp/>apparaît<sp/>pour<sp/>la<sp/>mise<sp/>à<sp/>jour<sp/>des<sp/>contraintes<sp/>au<sp/>point<sp/>d&apos;évaluation.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L639-L719),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L908-L931),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L579-L594)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Les<sp/>conditions<sp/>`input_function`<sp/>possèdent<sp/>des<sp/>masques<sp/>par<sp/>composante<sp/>:<sp/>`constrain_u/constrain_v/constrain_w`<sp/>pour<sp/>la<sp/>vitesse<sp/>;<sp/>sous-sections<sp/>`x/y/z`<sp/>avec<sp/>`type=input_function|no_flux`<sp/>pour<sp/>la<sp/>position.<sp/>Dans<sp/>ce<sp/>dernier<sp/>contexte,<sp/>`no_flux`<sp/>**laisse<sp/>la<sp/>composante<sp/>libre<sp/>de<sp/>Dirichlet**,<sp/>ce<sp/>n&apos;est<sp/>pas<sp/>automatiquement<sp/>un<sp/>blocage<sp/>normal.<sp/>Le<sp/>type<sp/>de<sp/>bord<sp/>global<sp/>`no_flux`<sp/>impose,<sp/>lui,<sp/>une<sp/>contrainte<sp/>de<sp/>flux<sp/>normal<sp/>de<sp/>position.<sp/>Les<sp/>contraintes<sp/>de<sp/>glissement/flux<sp/>sont<sp/>appliquées<sp/>identifiant<sp/>de<sp/>bord<sp/>par<sp/>identifiant<sp/>pour<sp/>conserver<sp/>les<sp/>coins,<sp/>au<sp/>lieu<sp/>de<sp/>mélanger<sp/>leurs<sp/>normales.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L44-L59),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L197-L213),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L402-L459),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L495-L514),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L612-L700)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Pour<sp/>le<sp/>traceur,<sp/>`input_function`<sp/>n&apos;impose<sp/>fortement<sp/>que<sp/>`phi`,<sp/>pas<sp/>le<sp/>potentiel<sp/>ni<sp/>`psi`.<sp/>Les<sp/>fonctions<sp/>de<sp/>bord<sp/>CHNS<sp/>reçoivent<sp/>le<sp/>temps<sp/>courant<sp/>et<sp/>leur<sp/>valeur<sp/>est<sp/>interpolée<sp/>sur<sp/>le<sp/>mapping<sp/>mobile.<sp/>Le<sp/>mouillage<sp/>est<sp/>séparé<sp/>:<sp/>un<sp/>angle<sp/>dans<sp/>[0°,180°]<sp/>active<sp/>le<sp/>terme<sp/>de<sp/>contact<sp/>;<sp/>sa<sp/>valeur<sp/>négative<sp/>le<sp/>désactive.<sp/>La<sp/>fabrique<sp/>ajoute<sp/>l&apos;assembleur<sp/>de<sp/>contact<sp/>si<sp/>au<sp/>moins<sp/>un<sp/>bord<sp/>a<sp/>un<sp/>angle<sp/>actif.<sp/>L&apos;équation<sp/>de<sp/>bord<sp/>est<sp/>traitée<sp/>avec<sp/>les<sp/>formulations<sp/>physiques<sp/>dans<sp/>l&apos;autre<sp/>fiche.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L594-L601),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L639-L691),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/boundary_conditions.cpp#L278-L330),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/assembly/incompressible_chns_assemblers.h#L459-L470)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>5.<sp/>Boucle<sp/>temporelle<sp/>et<sp/>reprise</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`run()`<sp/>remet<sp/>l&apos;état<sp/>à<sp/>zéro,<sp/>initialise,<sp/>exécute<sp/>les<sp/>sous-intervalles<sp/>puis<sp/>finalise.<sp/>Chaque<sp/>pas<sp/>avance<sp/>le<sp/>temps,<sp/>actualise<sp/>fonctions<sp/>et<sp/>BC,<sp/>résout<sp/>le<sp/>problème<sp/>non<sp/>linéaire<sp/>(sauf<sp/>chemins<sp/>d&apos;initialisation/MMS),<sp/>calcule<sp/>CFL<sp/>et<sp/>critère<sp/>temporel<sp/>spécifique,<sp/>puis<sp/>vérifie<sp/>l&apos;acceptation.<sp/>Après<sp/>acceptation<sp/>viennent<sp/>post-traitement,<sp/>éventuelle<sp/>adaptation<sp/>déjà<sp/>générique,<sp/>rotation<sp/>des<sp/>solutions<sp/>et<sp/>checkpoint.<sp/>Le<sp/>checkpoint<sp/>est<sp/>explicitement<sp/>écrit<sp/>**après**<sp/>rotation<sp/>des<sp/>historiques.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L340-L407),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L414-L422)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>restart<sp/>charge<sp/>la<sp/>triangulation<sp/>puis<sp/>recrée<sp/>les<sp/>DoFs<sp/>avant<sp/>de<sp/>lire<sp/>le<sp/>fichier<sp/>de<sp/>chaque<sp/>rang<sp/>contenant<sp/>solution,<sp/>historiques<sp/>et<sp/>temps.<sp/>Un<sp/>checkpoint<sp/>stationnaire<sp/>peut<sp/>initialiser<sp/>un<sp/>calcul<sp/>transitoire<sp/>en<sp/>recopiant<sp/>la<sp/>solution<sp/>courante<sp/>dans<sp/>les<sp/>emplacements<sp/>historiques<sp/>;<sp/>sinon<sp/>la<sp/>taille<sp/>d&apos;historique<sp/>doit<sp/>correspondre.<sp/>Ce<sp/>format<sp/>n&apos;est<sp/>pas<sp/>le<sp/>cache<sp/>indépendant<sp/>de<sp/>la<sp/>partition<sp/>du<sp/>presolver.<sp/>La<sp/>combinaison<sp/>restart<sp/>+<sp/>AMR<sp/>arborescent<sp/>est<sp/>déjà<sp/>refusée<sp/>à<sp/>la<sp/>référence<sp/>pré-AMR.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L1373-L1495),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L282-L286)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>restart<sp/>restaure<sp/>aussi<sp/>les<sp/>entrées<sp/>PVD<sp/>volume/peau<sp/>jusqu&apos;au<sp/>temps<sp/>du<sp/>checkpoint.<sp/>La<sp/>lecture<sp/>tolère<sp/>l&apos;absence<sp/>de<sp/>fichier,<sp/>puis<sp/>les<sp/>entrées<sp/>du<sp/>temps<sp/>réécrit<sp/>ou<sp/>du<sp/>même<sp/>nom<sp/>sont<sp/>retirées<sp/>avant<sp/>ajout,<sp/>afin<sp/>de<sp/>prolonger<sp/>une<sp/>série<sp/>temporelle<sp/>cohérente.<sp/>Il<sp/>s&apos;agit<sp/>de<sp/>l&apos;historique<sp/>de<sp/>visualisation,<sp/>distinct<sp/>de<sp/>l&apos;historique<sp/>BDF<sp/>stocké<sp/>dans<sp/>les<sp/>vecteurs.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/post_processing_handler.cpp#L12-L56),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/post_processing_handler.cpp#L208-L243),<sp/>[Suppression<sp/>avant<sp/>réajout](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/include/post_processing_handler.h#L751-L759)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>6.<sp/>Observer<sp/>ce<sp/>que<sp/>le<sp/>calcul<sp/>produit</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Le<sp/>hook<sp/>CHNS<sp/>appelle<sp/>les<sp/>indicateurs<sp/>multiphases,<sp/>les<sp/>sondes<sp/>de<sp/>ligne<sp/>puis,<sp/>si<sp/>demandé,<sp/>le<sp/>CSV<sp/>des<sp/>échelles<sp/>temporelles.<sp/>La<sp/>sonde<sp/>échantillonne<sp/>un<sp/>segment<sp/>défini<sp/>en<sp/>coordonnées<sp/>physiques<sp/>grâce<sp/>à<sp/>`RemotePointEvaluation`<sp/>sur<sp/>`moving_mapping`;<sp/>elle<sp/>vérifie<sp/>que<sp/>tous<sp/>ses<sp/>points<sp/>sont<sp/>trouvés,<sp/>rassemble<sp/>pression,<sp/>traceur,<sp/>potentiel,<sp/>vitesse,<sp/>gradient<sp/>et<sp/>éventuellement<sp/>`psi`,<sp/>puis<sp/>écrit<sp/>un<sp/>CSV<sp/>sur<sp/>le<sp/>rang<sp/>0.<sp/>Une<sp/>même<sp/>sortie<sp/>peut<sp/>contenir<sp/>pression<sp/>inconnue,<sp/>pression<sp/>reconstruite,<sp/>terme<sp/>d&apos;énergie<sp/>libre<sp/>et<sp/>mobilité<sp/>:<sp/>leurs<sp/>noms<sp/>doivent<sp/>être<sp/>interprétés<sp/>selon<sp/>le<sp/>modèle<sp/>CHNS<sp/>choisi.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1556-L1627),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1670-L1754),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1759-L1797)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Les<sp/>diagnostics<sp/>de<sp/>qualité<sp/>de<sp/>maillage<sp/>préexistent<sp/>à<sp/>l&apos;AMR.<sp/>Ils<sp/>demandent<sp/>un<sp/>champ<sp/>métrique<sp/>portant<sp/>sur<sp/>`phase_tracer`,<sp/>composante<sp/>0,<sp/>et<sp/>des<sp/>simplexes.<sp/>Le<sp/>mode<sp/>`interface_resolution`<sp/>est<sp/>2D<sp/>:<sp/>il<sp/>distingue<sp/>le<sp/>gain<sp/>de<sp/>compression<sp/>volumique,<sp/>le<sp/>rapport<sp/>local<sp/>`epsilon/(0.64*h_n)`<sp/>et<sp/>une<sp/>bande<sp/>de<sp/>cellules<sp/>résolues<sp/>connectées<sp/>à<sp/>l&apos;interface.<sp/>Le<sp/>graphe<sp/>de<sp/>voisinage<sp/>est<sp/>rassemblé<sp/>entre<sp/>rangs<sp/>MPI<sp/>;<sp/>ce<sp/>parcours<sp/>rejette<sp/>certaines<sp/>faces<sp/>pendantes.<sp/>Ce<sp/>sont<sp/>des<sp/>**sorties<sp/>de<sp/>mesure**,<sp/>pas<sp/>des<sp/>décisions<sp/>AMR.<sp/>L&apos;autre<sp/>mode<sp/>évalue<sp/>la<sp/>qualité<sp/>par<sp/>métrique<sp/>de<sp/>graphe,<sp/>avec<sp/>transport<sp/>du<sp/>gradient<sp/>reconstruit<sp/>par<sp/>une<sp/>moyenne<sp/>de<sp/>`F^{-T}`<sp/>en<sp/>ALE.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1092-L1228),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1233-L1252),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1314-L1348),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1391-L1473),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L1478-L1553)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">L&apos;export<sp/>`Elasticity/write<sp/>final<sp/>msh`<sp/>est<sp/>celui<sp/>du<sp/>**résultat<sp/>du<sp/>solveur<sp/>d&apos;élasticité**.<sp/>Il<sp/>exige<sp/>un<sp/>maillage<sp/>d&apos;entrée<sp/>`.msh`<sp/>et<sp/>l&apos;API<sp/>Gmsh.<sp/>Le<sp/>code<sp/>rouvre<sp/>les<sp/>nœuds<sp/>du<sp/>fichier<sp/>d&apos;origine,<sp/>y<sp/>évalue<sp/>le<sp/>champ<sp/>de<sp/>position<sp/>FE<sp/>distribué,<sp/>remplace<sp/>leurs<sp/>coordonnées<sp/>et<sp/>écrit<sp/>`linear_elasticity_final_mesh.msh`<sp/>avec<sp/>le<sp/>préfixe<sp/>de<sp/>sortie.<sp/>Il<sp/>s&apos;exécute<sp/>avant<sp/>`move_mesh()`,<sp/>comme<sp/>l&apos;écriture<sp/>du<sp/>cache.<sp/>Cette<sp/>commande<sp/>ne<sp/>constitue<sp/>ni<sp/>un<sp/>checkpoint<sp/>CHNS<sp/>ni<sp/>un<sp/>export<sp/>automatique<sp/>de<sp/>chaque<sp/>pas<sp/>CHNS.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L705-L714),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L809-L855),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L1105-L1114)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
