<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Ce<sp/>que<sp/>le<sp/>nouveau<sp/>couplage<sp/>AMR<sp/>change<sp/>précisément</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Les<sp/>cinq<sp/>différences<sp/>ci-dessous<sp/>comparent<sp/>**la<sp/>même<sp/>branche<sp/>avant/après**,<sp/>`cc8dace`<sp/>→<sp/>`35d43b8e`.<sp/>Elles<sp/>ne<sp/>décrivent<sp/>pas<sp/>une<sp/>fusion<sp/>de<sp/>branches.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Point<sp/>|<sp/>Avant,<sp/>référence<sp/>du<sp/>16<sp/>septembre<sp/>|<sp/>Nouveau<sp/>couplage<sp/>du<sp/>18<sp/>septembre<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|---|---|---|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Lieu<sp/>de<sp/>création<sp/>du<sp/>presolver<sp/>|<sp/>Fabrique<sp/>exécutée<sp/>dans<sp/>`main`,<sp/>avant<sp/>CHNS.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/solvers/incompressible_chns_ale.cpp#L41-L48)<sp/>|<sp/>En<sp/>AMR,<sp/>création<sp/>différée<sp/>dans<sp/>`CHNSSolver::initialize_solution`<sp/>avec<sp/>la<sp/>triangulation<sp/>CHNS<sp/>partagée.<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L91-L101)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Propriété<sp/>et<sp/>post-traitement<sp/>du<sp/>maillage<sp/>|<sp/>Le<sp/>presolver<sp/>lit<sp/>son<sp/>maillage<sp/>propre,<sp/>puis<sp/>en<sp/>déplace<sp/>les<sp/>sommets<sp/>pour<sp/>ses<sp/>sorties.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L224-L233),<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L1105-L1114)<sp/>|<sp/>Le<sp/>chemin<sp/>emprunté<sp/>ne<sp/>relit<sp/>pas<sp/>le<sp/>maillage<sp/>et<sp/>visualise<sp/>via<sp/>un<sp/>mapping<sp/>déformé<sp/>sans<sp/>déplacer<sp/>la<sp/>référence<sp/>;<sp/>cache<sp/>et<sp/>export<sp/>final<sp/>msh<sp/>interdits<sp/>dans<sp/>cette<sp/>combinaison.<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L258-L270),<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/elasticity_solver.cpp#L1161-L1177),<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L133-L142)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Initialisation<sp/>et<sp/>historiques<sp/>|<sp/>Injection<sp/>puis<sp/>rotation<sp/>depuis<sp/>`set_initial_conditions`.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L744-L805)<sp/>|<sp/>Reconstruction<sp/>des<sp/>contraintes<sp/>de<sp/>pression<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>comprimée,<sp/>remplissage<sp/>explicite<sp/>de<sp/>chaque<sp/>historique<sp/>avant<sp/>rotation.<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/incompressible_chns_solver.cpp#L103-L121)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Préraffinement<sp/>du<sp/>maillage<sp/>comprimé<sp/>|<sp/>Boucle<sp/>générique<sp/>réappliquant<sp/>`set_initial_conditions(false)`.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L302-L317)<sp/>|<sp/>Presolve<sp/>avant<sp/>préraffinement<sp/>pour<sp/>FixedNumber<sp/>et<sp/>InterfaceBand,<sp/>puis<sp/>réinterpolation<sp/>physique<sp/>en<sp/>conservant<sp/>la<sp/>position<sp/>transférée<sp/>;<sp/>pas<sp/>de<sp/>généralisation<sp/>à<sp/>FixedFraction.<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L302-L342)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Reconstruction<sp/>après<sp/>changement<sp/>topologique<sp/>|<sp/>Contraintes<sp/>et<sp/>parcimonie<sp/>reconstruites<sp/>avant<sp/>transfert.<sp/>[Source<sp/>pré-AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/cc8dace141900b82e5790fa878e39d9c54898784/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L1317-L1341)<sp/>|<sp/>Transport<sp/>et<sp/>restauration<sp/>des<sp/>positions<sp/>avant<sp/>contraintes<sp/>physiques<sp/>;<sp/>ajout<sp/>de<sp/>l&apos;état<sp/>temporel<sp/>supplémentaire<sp/>au<sp/>transfert.<sp/>Voir<sp/>[le<sp/>motif<sp/>AMR](../../prod/html/fez_prod_distributed_state_transfer.html).<sp/>[Source<sp/>AMR](https://github.com/arthurbawin/fez/blob/35d43b8e3bc4cae33a6ed7b6b57a6f3d77e93858/src/navier_stokes_solver.cpp#L1433-L1516)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Invariants<sp/>à<sp/>garder<sp/>pour<sp/>les<sp/>ajouts<sp/>suivants</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Les<sp/>champs<sp/>physiques<sp/>et<sp/>les<sp/>BC<sp/>doivent<sp/>être<sp/>évalués<sp/>sur<sp/>la<sp/>géométrie<sp/>portée<sp/>par<sp/>`evaluation_point`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>La<sp/>géométrie<sp/>comprimée<sp/>enlarged<sp/>et<sp/>son<sp/>`psi`<sp/>doivent<sp/>traverser<sp/>ensemble<sp/>le<sp/>passage<sp/>presolver<sp/>→<sp/>CHNS.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Le<sp/>cache<sp/>s&apos;identifie<sp/>par<sp/>données<sp/>géométriques<sp/>et<sp/>composantes,<sp/>pas<sp/>par<sp/>indices<sp/>DoF<sp/>globaux.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">4.<sp/>Les<sp/>sondes,<sp/>historiques<sp/>PVD,<sp/>checkpoints<sp/>et<sp/>cache<sp/>sont<sp/>quatre<sp/>mécanismes<sp/>différents.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">5.<sp/>Une<sp/>option<sp/>parsée,<sp/>un<sp/>commentaire<sp/>et<sp/>un<sp/>fichier<sp/>test<sp/>ne<sp/>remplacent<sp/>pas<sp/>la<sp/>preuve<sp/>d&apos;un<sp/>chemin<sp/>exécuté.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Ces<sp/>invariants<sp/>sont<sp/>tirés<sp/>des<sp/>fonctions<sp/>précédentes<sp/>;<sp/>ils<sp/>servent<sp/>de<sp/>points<sp/>de<sp/>relecture<sp/>des<sp/>prochains<sp/>changements.<sp/>Le<sp/>détail<sp/>du<sp/>cache<sp/>et<sp/>de<sp/>ses<sp/>limites<sp/>est<sp/>conservé<sp/>dans<sp/>[presolver,<sp/>cache<sp/>et<sp/>géométrie](../patterns/presolver-cache-geometry.md).</highlight></codeline>
